27:- **D2. Phase 1 - 4 skill-agents** (each genuinely adopts ONE skill via the Skill tool, verified by stream `Skill` tool_use) + the Project Context Pack -> each emits, through its lens: queries, accept/reject rubric, per-element hunt-list. Lens-isolated (decorrelated).
